{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06264","headline":"赠轻车 · 崔颢","name":"赠轻车","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠远行归，经春涉长道。\n幽冀桑始青，洛阳蚕欲老。\n忆昨戎马地，别时心草草。\n烽火从北来，边城闭常早。\n平生少相遇，未得展怀抱。\n今日杯酒间，见君交情好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}